      "termEn": "safe state",
      "termCn": "安全状态",
      "explanationCn": "系统存在某种安全序列，使所有进程都能顺利完成。",
      "explanationEn": "",
      "chapterId": "ch08",
      "chapterName": "deadlocks"
    },
    {
      "id": "os-ch08-term-010",
      "termEn": "banker’s algorithm",
      "termCn": "银行家算法",
      "explanationCn": "根据最大需求、已分配资源和可用资源判断分配是否安全。",
